@startuml 28_interaction_overview
title V0.1.0 pilot acceptance interaction overview
start
:Install signed Windows / Ubuntu-Debian agent package;
:User initiates pairing in local setup UI;
:Operator verifies code and approves in dashboard;
:Service starts HTTPS reporting at boot;
:FastAPI persists samples + process snapshot;
:Operator views workspace-scoped metrics/history;
:Stop agent; observe STALE + last-known notice;
:Restart agent; observe CONNECTED without re-pair;
:Test revoked token 401 + unchanged heartbeat;
:Test nonmember/viewer cannot approve/revoke;
:Test uninstall, service restart and credential persistence;
:Test Linux and Windows independently;
:Verify production release and rollback checklist;
stop
@enduml
